{"availability":"available","full":"mahan-mgn/MusicBazi","name":"MusicBazi","description":"High-performance self-hosted music streaming and downloader. Public catalog metadata (Apple Music, Deezer, Spotify), smart audio resolving via YouTube & SoundCloud, lossless transcoding, synced lyrics, offline resilience & native Android app.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-05T20:03:07Z","updated":"2026-10-10T20:51:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://musicbazi-production.up.railway.app/","topics":["apple-music","capacitor","deezer","fastapi","music","music-downloader","offline-first","persian","pwa","react","rtl","self-hosted","soundcloud","spotify","streaming","tailwindcss","telegram-bot","typescript","youtube","yt-dlp"],"demo":"https://musicbazi-production.up.railway.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.637Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.637Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.637Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.637Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["High-performance, self-hosted music streaming and downloader with public catalog aggregation, smart audio resolving, lossless transcoding, offline resilience, and a native Android application.","Features • Quick Start • Mobile Setup • Architecture • API Reference • Releases","Music Bazi bridges the gap between commercial streaming platforms and self-hosted personal music libraries. It queries public metadata catalogs (Apple Music, Deezer, Spotify, and YouTube Music) to index tracks, albums, and playlists, then intelligently locates, extracts, and transcodes high-quality audio from open sources (YouTube, YouTube Music, and SoundCloud via yt-dlp and an isolated InnerTubeX Kotlin microservice bridge)."],"features":["Keyless Public Catalogs: Direct search and metadata indexing via Apple Music (iTunes Search API) and Deezer API with zero API keys required.","YouTube Music & Channel Catalog: Search and full artist catalog scraping (top songs, releases, albums, singles, official videos, subscriber counts, and channel panoramic banners) via ytmusicapi and enhanced yt-dlp.","Spotify Integration: Instant URL resolution via public oEmbed, with optional Spotify Web API credentials for exact playlist and album parsing.","Rich Discography Views & Batch Playback: View full artist profiles, top tracks, albums, singles, video tabs, and multi-release queue management.","Official Artist Badges & Video Cards: Visual distinction for verified channels (OfficialArtistBadgeIcon), interactive video cards, and formatted view counts."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mahan-mgn/MusicBazi/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9d6a95623cbb6045e13ed15db13569f09e60ff7e2bf9835c2c0c5abb89469e63","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.815Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.815Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"High-performance, self-hosted music streaming and downloader with public catalog aggregation, smart audio resolving, lossless transcoding, offline resilience, and a native Android application.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mahan-mgn/MusicBazi/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Keyless Public Catalogs: Direct search and metadata indexing via Apple Music (iTunes Search API) and Deezer API with zero API keys required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mahan-mgn/MusicBazi/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"9d6a95623cbb6045e13ed15db13569f09e60ff7e2bf9835c2c0c5abb89469e63","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mahan-mgn/MusicBazi/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.815Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T20:51:06Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mahan-mgn/MusicBazi/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:56.817Z","hash":"9d6a95623cbb6045e13ed15db13569f09e60ff